### Requests for the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### Start the API first (cabal run ledger-api), then click "Send Request"
### above any block.

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### List accounts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts

### Transfer with an idempotency key (send it twice: same result, money moves once)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payroll-1

{ "from": "acme-ops", "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 150000, "memo": "September payroll" }

### Same key, different request (expect 409 idempotency_key_reused)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: payroll-1

{ "from": "acme-ops", "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 1 }

### Overdraft (expect 422 insufficient_funds)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from": "acme-payroll", "to": "acme-ops", "amountCents": 99999999 }

### Deposit from outside the ledger
POST http://localhost:8080/api/deposits
Content-Type: application/json

{ "to": "acme-payroll", "amountCents": 50000 }

### Open a new account
POST http://localhost:8080/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "acme-savings", "name": "Acme Savings" }

### Entries for payroll
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/acme-payroll/entries
